{"speciesId":779,"names":{"fr":"Denticrisse","es":"Bruxish","en":"Bruxish","ja":"ハギギシリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Lorsqu’il utilise l’appendice sur sa tête pour projeter ses pouvoirs psychiques, il émet un bruit aussi irritant qu’un grincement de dents."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando la protuberancia que tiene en la cabeza emite poderes psíquicos, se escucha como un ruido de dientes rechinando muy molesto."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"When it unleashes its psychic power from the protuberance on its head, the grating sound of grinding teeth echoes through the area."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"頭の 突起から サイコパワーを 放つとき とても 耳障りな 歯ぎしりの 音が あたりに 響く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il engourdit ses proies grâce à sa force mentale avant de les dévorer avec ses grosses dents. Il peut briser les Kokiyas sans problème."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Paraliza a su presa con poderes telequinéticos y la hace picadillo con su robusta dentadura. Ni siquiera Shellder se le resiste."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It stuns its prey with psychokinesis and then grinds them to mush with its strong teeth. Even Shellder’s shell is no match for it."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"念力で 獲物を しびれさせ 丈夫な 歯で 噛み砕く。 シェルダーの 殻でも よゆうだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Enfoui dans le sable, il projette ses pouvoirs psychiques via l’appendice qu’il a sur la tête, et scanne les environs en attendant sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Oculto bajo la arena, emite poderes psíquicos por la protuberancia de su cabeza. Analiza el entorno mientras espera a que caiga su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It burrows beneath the sand, radiating psychic power from the protuberance on its head. It waits for prey as it surveys the area."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"砂に 潜り 頭の 突起から サイコパワーを 放射。 あたりの 様子を 探りつつ 獲物を 待つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa peau est si épaisse que même les épines de Vorastérie ne peuvent la percer. Il les croque bruyamment grâce à ses dents solides."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su piel es tan gruesa que ni las espinas de Mareanie pueden perforarla. Con su fuerte dentadura tritura y engulle dichas espinas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its skin is thick enough to fend off Mareanie’s spikes. With its robust teeth, Bruxish crunches up the spikes and eats them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ヒドイデの ハリも 通さないほど 分厚い 皮膚。 丈夫な 歯で ボリボリと ハリを かじって 食う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":779,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[25,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confusion","learns":[[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",9]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"agility","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rage","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[17,"level-up",36],[18,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[